nts</strong> set within a decaying, abandoned hospital full of hidden meanings and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbolic ghosts</strong> that are more than just threats \u2014 they are haunting reflections of your forgotten past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven experience</strong> where the story unfolds gradually through exploration and interaction with mysterious events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Estimated Playtime:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly <strong>00:40 to 01:30 hours</strong>, depending on your exploration and choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Cinematic Audio Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtracks and audio cues designed to amplify fear, immersion, and atmosphere.</p>",
